<title>USA: Sento Technical Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Sento Technical Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OREM, Utah 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended     11 Mos ended 12 mos ended</p>
<p>			 3/31/97    4/30/96     3/31/97     4/30/96</p>
<p> Net sales	$3,677,348 $3,192,088 $17,609,586 $13,873,401</p>
<p> Cost of sales   2,367,138  1,844,736  11,441,558   8,452,043</p>
<p> Gross Profit    1,310,210  1,347,352   6,168,028   5,421,358</p>
<p> Net Income	   81,404     15,337	22,416     339,555</p>
<p> Net per share	 $0.02	$0.01	 $0.01	 $0.08</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs   4,301,187  3,992,768   4,251,240   3,992,768</p>
<p>NOTES: Full co name is Sento Technical Innovations Corp.</p>
<p>The company changed its fiscal year-end to March 31 from April 30, therefore fiscal 1997 earnings reflect just 11 months results.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
